2025-10-08 12:28:25,168 [WARNING] Skipped idx=633: gold or llm supporting sentence is empty. gold='', llm='Supporting sentence: The expression of all 5 N-terminal isoforms (TAp73, DeltaNp73, DeltaN'p73, Ex2p73 and Ex2/3p73) was measured by real-time RT-PCR. In humans, five N-terminal isoforms of p73 have been identified, including TAp73. These isoforms are generated through alternative splicing and include TAp73, DeltaNp73, DeltaN'p73, Ex2p73, and Ex2/3p73. TAp73 is the full-length, transactivating form of p73, which is a key regulator in various cellular processes, including apoptosis and cell cycle regulation. The other isoforms, such as DeltaNp73 and DeltaN'p73, are truncated forms that lack the N-terminal transactivation domain and are often associated with dominant-negative effects. Ex2p73 and Ex2/3p73 are less common splice variants that include additional exons.'
